  "summary": "Install-time host-identity beacon to webhook.site",
  "details": "setup.py defines a custom install cmdclass (InstallWithBeacon) that, on `pip install`, collects the installer's hostname and resolved local IP address and POSTs them as JSON to the hardcoded anonymous endpoint https://webhook.site/db090426-8eae-4ff6-8be9-5a9fa2a6e53a before completing installation. The beacon runs automatically from the sdist build with no user consent or opt-out and sends installer host identifiers to a third-party anonymous collector unrelated to any declared publisher infrastructure.",
